* circuitlog_chapter1_decision (esim netlist via kicad-cli kicadxml)

* u1 net__u1_password0 net__u1_authorized0 unlock door_lock
* u2 net__u2_in1 net__u1_password0 adc_bridge_1
* u3 net__u3_in1 net__u1_authorized0 adc_bridge_1
* u4 unlock unlock_out dac_bridge_1
v1 net__u2_in1 0 pulse(0 5 0 1e-9 1e-9 5e-3 1e-2)
v2 net__u3_in1 0 pulse(0 5 2.5e-3 1e-9 1e-9 5e-3 1e-2)
a1 [net__u1_password0 ] [net__u1_authorized0 ] [unlock ] u1
a2 [net__u2_in1 ] [net__u1_password0 ] u2
a3 [net__u3_in1 ] [net__u1_authorized0 ] u3
a4 [unlock ] [unlock_out ] u4
* Schematic Name:                             door_lock, Ngspice Name: door_lock
.model u1 door_lock(rise_delay=1.0e-9 fall_delay=1.0e-9 input_load=1.0e-12 instance_id=1 ) 
* Schematic Name:                             adc_bridge_1, Ngspice Name: adc_bridge
.model u2 adc_bridge(in_low=1.0 in_high=2.0 rise_delay=1.0e-9 fall_delay=1.0e-9 ) 
* Schematic Name:                             adc_bridge_1, Ngspice Name: adc_bridge
.model u3 adc_bridge(in_low=1.0 in_high=2.0 rise_delay=1.0e-9 fall_delay=1.0e-9 ) 
* Schematic Name:                             dac_bridge_1, Ngspice Name: dac_bridge
.model u4 dac_bridge(out_low=0.0 out_high=5.0 out_undef=0.5 input_load=1.0e-12 t_rise=1.0e-9 t_fall=1.0e-9 ) 
.tran 10e-06 10e-03 0e-00

* Control Statements 
.control
set width=1000
run
print allv > plot_data_v.txt
print alli > plot_data_i.txt
set filetype=ascii
write plot_data.raw
.endc
.end
